# Netlify redirects
#
# Spam update cleanup (Oct 2026) - see seo-recovery/spam-update-recovery-plan.md
# Rules only fire when no built page exists at the path, so live pages are never shadowed.
# Order matters: first match wins, so specific 301s sit above the catch-all 410s.

# Ensure robots.txt and sitemap.xml are accessible
/robots.txt   /robots.txt   200
/sitemap.xml  /sitemap.xml  200
/favicon.ico  /favicon.ico  200

# Prevent 404s for common requests
/admin/*      /index.html   404
/api/*        /index.html   404

